Subtask 3.2: Test Network Isolation Policies
Now let's test our network policies to ensure they're working as expected.

Test blocked communication:
echo "=== Testing Network Isolation Policies ==="
echo

# Test 1: Try to ping from development to production (should work - ICMP allowed)
echo "Test 1: Ping from development to production VM"
ssh -i ~/.ssh/lab_key labuser@$DEV_VM_IP "ping -c 3 $PROD_VM_IP"
echo

# Test 2: Try to access blocked ports (should fail)
echo "Test 2: Try to access blocked port 443 from development to production"
ssh -i ~/.ssh/lab_key labuser@$DEV_VM_IP "timeout 5 telnet $PROD_VM_IP 443 || echo 'Connection blocked as expected'"
echo

# Test 3: Try to access allowed HTTP port (should work)
echo "Test 3: Try to access allowed HTTP port 80 from development to production"
ssh -i ~/.ssh/lab_key labuser@$DEV_VM_IP "curl -m 5 http://$PROD_VM_IP || echo 'HTTP access blocked'"
echo
Test SSH access policies:
# Test 4: SSH from production to development (should work - SSH allowed)
echo "Test 4: SSH access from production to development VM"
ssh -i ~/.ssh/lab_key labuser@$PROD_VM_IP << EOF
# Try to SSH to development VM
timeout 10 ssh -o ConnectTimeout=5 -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no labuser@$DEV_VM_IP 'echo "SSH connection successful"' || echo "SSH connection failed or timed out"
EOF
echo

# Test 5: Try reverse SSH (development to production - should be blocked)
echo "Test 5: SSH access from development to production VM (should be blocked)"
ssh -i ~/.ssh/lab_key labuser@$DEV_VM_IP << EOF
timeout 10 ssh -o ConnectTimeout=5 -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no labuser@$PROD_VM_IP 'echo "SSH connection successful"' || echo "SSH connection blocked as expected"
EOF
echo
Test time-based policies:
# Test 6: Check current time and database port access
echo "Test 6: Testing time-based database access policy"
echo "Current time: $(date)"
echo "Business hours policy: Mon-Fri 09:00-17:00"

# Try to connect to MySQL port (3306)
ssh -i ~/.ssh/lab_key labuser@$DEV_VM_IP << EOF
echo "Attempting database connection to port 3306..."
timeout 5 telnet $PROD_VM_IP 3306 || echo "Database connection blocked (expected outside business hours or no MySQL service)"
EOF
echo
